DUSD::setFlashMintCap()
├── given caller is not owner
│   └── it should revert with OwnableUnauthorizedAccount
└── given caller is owner
    ├── when setting flash mint cap to zero
    │   ├── it should set flashMintCap to zero
    │   └── it should emit SetFlashMintCap event with old and new cap
    ├── when setting flash mint cap to non-zero value
    │   ├── it should set flashMintCap to the new value
    │   └── it should emit SetFlashMintCap event with old and new cap
    └── when setting flash mint cap to same value
        ├── it should update flashMintCap to the same value
        └── it should emit SetFlashMintCap event with old and new cap
